# Synthetic vLLM Prometheus structural-union fixture; this is not a captured scrape.
# Labels and values are non-production placeholders. Shapes cover vllm-project/vllm
# @ adf15cadb9d0151663b001a7286674892c4daa3c and @ dc818c198d3ff50a16f38eba567da006478239c8.
# Mutually exclusive model modes and KV connectors coexist only to exercise profile routing.
# Deprecated CPU-offload aliases coexist with replacements so policy can prove they are suppressed.
